# Redirect http+www to https+non-www in a single hop (must precede the two rules below,
# otherwise Netlify's own http->https upgrade fires first and creates a 2-hop chain)
http://www.finxiacapital.com/* https://finxiacapital.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect www to non-www
https://www.finxiacapital.com/* https://finxiacapital.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect http to https (if custom domain configured)
http://finxiacapital.com/* https://finxiacapital.com/:splat 301!
